Package: vitalBayes
Title: Bayesian Life History Parameter Estimation for Elasmobranchs
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = c("Brian", "J"), family = "Moe", email = "brian.moe@MYFWC.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: `vitalBayes` is an R package implementing innovative Bayesian 
    hierarchical models for estimating life history parameters in elasmobranch 
    populations. The package addresses critical methodological challenges in 
    shark and ray research, including sparse datasets, imbalanced sex ratios, 
    and the need for biologically coherent parameter estimation.
